# Line endings are LF everywhere — in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this the result depends on each developer's core.autocrlf, and on
# Windows (autocrlf=true) every file reads as modified with an empty diff. The
# CI matrix runs on Linux, Windows and macOS, so pinning it is the only way the
# same checkout is byte-identical on all three.
#
# It also has to hold for test/fixtures/, which the tests byte-compare against
# renderer output built with "\n". Marking those binary (-text) would freeze
# whatever endings happened to be on disk and fail the comparison.
* text=auto eol=lf
